<script setup lang="ts">import {computed} from 'vue';import VChart from 'vue-echarts';import {use} from 'echarts/core';import {CanvasRenderer} from 'echarts/renderers';import {BarChart,LineChart,PieChart} from 'echarts/charts';import {GridComponent,LegendComponent,TooltipComponent} from 'echarts/components';use([CanvasRenderer,BarChart,LineChart,PieChart,GridComponent,LegendComponent,TooltipComponent]);const trend=computed(()=>({tooltip:{trigger:'axis'},grid:{left:38,right:20,top:25,bottom:28},xAxis:{type:'category',data:['07-07','07-08','07-09','07-10','07-11','07-12','07-13']},yAxis:{type:'value',splitLine:{lineStyle:{color:'#edf0ed'}}},series:[{name:'订单',type:'line',smooth:true,data:[86,105,98,142,128,176,193],areaStyle:{color:'rgba(11,64,60,.12)'},lineStyle:{color:'#0b403c'}},{name:'AI 会话',type:'line',smooth:true,data:[120,148,139,181,206,238,267],lineStyle:{color:'#b5482d'}}]}));const distribution=computed(()=>({tooltip:{trigger:'item'},legend:{bottom:0},series:[{type:'pie',radius:['45%','70%'],data:[{name:'岭南特产',value:38,itemStyle:{color:'#0b625b'}},{name:'港澳手信',value:24,itemStyle:{color:'#c79c4a'}},{name:'跨境零食',value:26,itemStyle:{color:'#b5482d'}},{name:'全球生鲜',value:12,itemStyle:{color:'#7d9a91'}}]}]}));</script>
<template><div class="page-head"><div><h1>运营总览</h1><p>跨境商城、知识、AI 与培训的实时聚合视图，不跨库直接查询。</p></div><el-button>刷新数据</el-button></div><div class="metric-grid"><div v-for="m in [{l:'今日模拟交易额',v:'¥ 28,630',s:'较昨日 +12.6%'},{l:'待处理订单',v:'38',s:'待支付 29 / 退款 9'},{l:'知识审核待办',v:'17',s:'3 条即将到期'},{l:'员工培训完成率',v:'78.4%',s:'逾期任务 12'}]" :key="m.l" class="metric panel"><span>{{m.l}}</span><b>{{m.v}}</b><small>{{m.s}}</small></div></div><div class="chart-grid"><section class="panel"><header><b class="serif">业务趋势</b><span>近 7 日</span></header><VChart :option="trend" autoresize/></section><section class="panel"><header><b class="serif">商品类目分布</b><span>在售 SKU</span></header><VChart :option="distribution" autoresize/></section></div><div class="bottom-grid"><section class="panel todo"><header><b class="serif">运营待办</b><el-tag type="danger">共 32 项</el-tag></header><article v-for="x in [{t:'知识审核',d:'《粤港澳跨境商品合规提示》等待复核',n:'8'},{t:'库存预警',d:'挪威三文鱼等 5 个 SKU 低于阈值',n:'5'},{t:'通知死信',d:'培训任务通知需要人工重放',n:'2'},{t:'培训逾期',d:'关务岗位 17 人未按期完成',n:'17'}]" :key="x.t"><span>{{x.t.slice(0,1)}}</span><div><b>{{x.t}}</b><small>{{x.d}}</small></div><el-badge :value="x.n"/></article></section><section class="panel services"><header><b class="serif">系统状态</b><span><i/>自动刷新</span></header><div v-for="x in [{n:'Gateway',s:'健康',r:'32%'},{n:'MySQL 集群',s:'健康',r:'48%'},{n:'Redis',s:'健康',r:'21%'},{n:'Elasticsearch',s:'本机场景启用',r:'66%'},{n:'RocketMQ',s:'按需启用',r:'—'}]" :key="x.n"><b>{{x.n}}</b><el-tag size="small" type="success">{{x.s}}</el-tag><span>{{x.r}}</span></div></section></div></template>
<style scoped>.chart-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:14px}.chart-grid section{height:330px;padding:16px}.chart-grid header,.bottom-grid header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;height:30px}.chart-grid header span,.bottom-grid header span{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.chart-grid .echarts{height:260px}.bottom-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:14px}.bottom-grid section{padding:16px}.todo article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:35px 1fr 30px;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.todo article>span{width:30px;height:30px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#edf3ef;color:var(--admin);font-weight:700}.todo b,.todo small{display:block}.todo small{margin-top:3px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.services>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 120px 45px;align-items:center;padding:11px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:12px}.services>div>span{text-align:right;color:var(--muted)}.services header i{display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;margin-right:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#38a67b}@media(max-width:900px){.chart-grid,.bottom-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
